@title Cooling what-if: the window leaves the Heat panel and the 3D picture usable
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The what-if window opens at the left, under the toolbar, instead of over the Heat panel on the right: with the ranked list showing, the Heat panel's buttons are still clickable (Simulate starts a run) and the cabinet in the middle is not covered.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Cooling what-if"
wait 20
expect "Cooling what-if"
click_text "Try the fixes"
wait_s 120
expect "Devices over limit"
shot list-beside-the-heat-panel
check_layout
check_blank list-beside-the-heat-panel
click_text "Simulate" Button #2
wait 20
expect "Simulating"
shot simulate-clicked
check_layout
